WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.400
Make room for the whole idea.
A launch plan is visible in the desktop app's document editor.

00:04.400 --> 00:08.200
Tools that fit the way you work.
The user switches to a custom launch-board app in the same project.

00:08.200 --> 00:12.700
Two tasks are marked complete.
The launch board updates from 50% to 83% complete.

00:12.700 --> 00:19.700
Keep the context close.
Audience notes appear in a floating document panel over the launch board.

00:19.700 --> 00:24.500
Make something that matters.
The floating document closes, returning to the launch board.
